---
title: "publishTgeDetails (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: Legion operator publishes TGE details
    q_check_caller --> q_check_ended: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_check_not_published: hasEnded == true
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: sale not yet ended
    q_check_not_published --> q_set_details: TGE details not yet published
    q_check_not_published --> q_revert_published: already published
    q_set_details --> [*]: askToken = _askToken, totalTokenSupply = _totalSupply, totalTokensAllocated = _allocated, emit TgeDetailsPublished(askToken, totalSupply)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_revert_published --> [*]: revert AlreadyPublished

    note right of q_set_details
        INV-001: askToken address set here (not at initialization since pre-TGE)
        INV-002: Publication only after sale ended and TGE completed
    end note
